A||N||5||bilbo||Hooking up driving/fog lights????||||1||
Z||000000||bilbo||06-15-2001||03:04 PM||||Where can I run the wire so I can hook it up to the fuse box and put in a switch? Can it go through the firewall in the front somehow???? Thanks||||reg||1
Z||000001||fierohoho||06-15-2001||03:44 PM||||bilbo, If you stand on the drivers side of the car with the hood open you will see on your right on the firewall a rubber grommet with a wire bundle going inside the car. Pull the grommet part way out and feed the wire through there or try too slide it through along side the wire bundle. Good luck<P>------------------<BR>'84 SE 2.5l<BR>'85 Coupe 2.5l now getting a 3800<BR>'86 SE 2.5l||||reg||1
Z||000002||cadaver||06-15-2001||04:12 PM||||Be sure to hok that wire up to a key hot wire not a constant hot wire. Because if you leave the switch on they will stay on.<BR>When I installed the last set I used a relay so they would only come on when the car was on AND when the lights were on. That was it all automatic and you dont forget and drive around in the daylight with them on.||||reg||1
Z||000003||danny boy||06-16-2001||02:33 AM|||| I ran a accessory lead through the with the main harness as said above into a relay and used the parking lights to turn the fog lights on. Worked very well.||||reg||1
Z||000004||skitime||06-16-2001||08:26 AM||||I don't have a rear defroster so I got a rear defroster switch and switch wiring harness.  The harness has all the right connnection to the fuse panel. I connected it to the parking lights so I have the blue dingy thing to remind me if I let them on.  I replaced the relay which was a timer relay to a normal relay.  Now I have a indicator light when the lights are on built into the switch and it looks factory. <P>------------------<BR><UL TYPE=SQUARE><BR><LI>Red 88 GT T-TOP<BR><LI>Red 86 GT<BR></UL><BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/pictures-1_5.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000005||pHoOl||06-16-2001||01:10 PM||||I just did mine this past weekend, i'll take some digital pics this weekend for you and post them.<P>------------------<BR>Fuzz busters are for those who can't outrun the cops.<P>AIM: phool88fiero<P>    <IMG SRC="http://www.gvsuphool.homestead.com/files/pHoOl_sig.gif"> ||||reg||1
